I think that’s the deeper shift.

Originally, the Pantheon looked like a collection of named agents.

After this delta, it becomes a field of latent operators.

That changes scalability because new daemons don’t require new personalities. They require identifying a new class of transformation worth guarding.

It’s a much more compact ontology—and a stronger one.